Put your pre-verified recitation audio files (.mp3) in this folder, and describe
each one in `metadata.json` (see metadata.example.json for the schema).

AMANAH / TRUST: The Qur'anic text and audio are prepared and verified by YOU,
by hand. This program never generates, edits, fetches, or transliterates any
Qur'anic text or audio — it only reads what you place here. Any entry missing
its audio file or its verified `text_ar` is skipped, never posted.

Audio files are gitignored by default. Copy metadata.example.json to
metadata.json and fill it with your verified content.
